{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>葵涌發生3車相撞車禍。今日（27日）上午9時11分，據報輕型貨車、中型貨車及小巴順序沿葵涌道往九龍方向行駛，當駛到葵涌道1013至1033號昌年大廈對開時，首兩車因應交通情況收慢，小巴懷疑收掣不及撞向前車，釀成3車連環相撞。救援人員接報到場為傷者治理。意外中，有5男4女受輕傷，其中包括一名孕婦。</p><p>根據網上圖片所見，綠色專線小巴撞到貨車車尾，車頭嚴重損毀，擋風玻璃碎裂。現場有大批警車戒備。網民形容：「成條葵涌道塞死晒。」</p><p>受交通意外影響，葵涌道（往九龍方向）近昌榮路迴旋處的部份行車線一度封閉。</p><figure><img alt=\"綠色專線小巴撞到貨車車尾，車頭嚴重損毀，擋風玻璃碎裂。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191692069161275392936724.png/hTpJdRnT7_tjGw2jCYpK_2EeLVoTXT--P6yGxT-shsU\"/><figcaption>綠色專線小巴撞到貨車車尾，車頭嚴重損毀，擋風玻璃碎裂。</figcaption></figure><p>警方經初步調查後表示，是次車禍共有9人受傷。其中，小巴上有3男4女（24至67歲）受輕傷；姓陳輕型貨車男司機（62歲）及姓黃小巴男司機（53歲）則報稱頭痛，9名傷者均清醒被送往仁濟醫院治理。</p><figure><img alt=\"小巴車頭擋風玻璃碎裂。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191700880554987520421806.jpeg/TItw1HNKj3yKep1OQ6Iw2pILngDMnLRc1GhwpdRocKU\"/><figcaption>小巴車頭擋風玻璃碎裂。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"小巴車頭擋風玻璃碎裂。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191701029020897280136450.jpeg/-KKm85M37_0LzUQu4kNe41ah4-7BvmAJIkF1SgdBdUo\"/><figcaption>小巴車頭擋風玻璃碎裂。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"玻璃碎片散落一地。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191701026164445184218693.jpeg/lv4qwQWuciiR1F8nvC1E3svZjvwL6mZFCS5nqSwuZ6k\"/><figcaption>玻璃碎片散落一地。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方安排拖車到場，將小巴拖走。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191701467854016512931845.jpeg/ymDMhXCCxYvNYNmr-QRd4NJfg2te7wQCS3r2bW569m0\"/><figcaption>警方安排拖車到場，將小巴拖走。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"受事故影響，現場交通擠塞。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191701470605611008857614.jpeg/6Egp3MURFLMLrpBDdNNDL07qq5splX3XetN_7F_Tf-w\"/><figcaption>受事故影響，現場交通擠塞。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"受事故影響，往九龍方向交通擠塞。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191701473252347904094357.jpeg/BUojs5i32J0ZSuRtO58HwK4N3arJS1xsIxeoIAYXqCA\"/><figcaption>受事故影響，往九龍方向交通擠塞。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"受事故影響，往九龍方向交通擠塞。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191701476092022784791653.jpeg/i4OVnqhIweJvJCZ7Wb7sxbiKkQ4AA6c2fNTNZ1nUzWc\"/><figcaption>受事故影響，往九龍方向交通擠塞。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有大批警員到場。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191701479409848320870923.jpeg/zRQRsY5AyZ1YCMiNt6F426paidOdyxLq5-EQr8LhEK8\"/><figcaption>有大批警員到場。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"救護車亦有到場。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191701460165857280918025.jpeg/2AjeyNJB6TUtPj6q8ZF3suy-1_qwrhCDUet5_HTrefw\"/><figcaption>救護車亦有到場。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場有大批警車戒備。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191692066602618880823704.png/rYrweVWqeZwk1oc4gB99dPsVUMdwvDiWANjvNwDY7zc\"/><figcaption>現場有大批警車戒備。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場交通擠塞。（Google Map路況圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261027/1191691742420668416032168.png/lN5qq_5AYLn0GCFjMLAwv_TtTIHBg6DOuTTx47k08eM\"/><figcaption>現場交通擠塞。（Google Map路況圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T07:43:16.135195+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":576,"images":12,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T02:08:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T08:38:58.487450+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T07:38:54.299693+00:00","content_hash":"0bba50438ef365348d829c02a29da58cb18e0cb702097c4579c7832ede248852","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}